"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap split pb-16 pt-8 md:pb-20 md:pt-12\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a href=\"/#track\" class=\"link text-sm\">← Back to the connected journey</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Tracked records / Chapter 02</p><h1 class=\"display\">See what expires.<br><span class=\"text-blue\">Act while<br>there’s time.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Keep expiry and review dates with the evidence they belong to. Give your team a clear view of what needs renewing, for whom and when.</p><a class=\"cta mt-3\" href=\"#demo\">See it in a demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Follow a credential</span><span class=\"text-xs\">Follow the renewal</span></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Manual handling</h3><span id=\"record-status\" class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Renewal approaching</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate\">Expiry date</p><p id=\"record-date\" class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-2xl\">30 Nov 2026</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-t-2 border-blue pt-5\"><p id=\"record-action\" class=\"text-sm\">Arrange renewal before the recorded expiry date.</p></div><p id=\"record-history\" class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-slate\">The existing evidence remains attached to Jamie’s record.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore the example record\"><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-record=\"added\" aria-pressed=\"false\">1. Added</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-record=\"due\" aria-pressed=\"true\">2. Renewal due</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-record=\"renewed\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3. Renewed</button></div><p id=\"record-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div><figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">Follow a certificate from upload through review and renewal.</figcaption></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"The workforce journey\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"wrap chapter-nav flex justify-between\"><a href=\"/#onboard\" data-chapter-link=\"onboard\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span><span>Onboard</span></a><a href=\"/#track\" data-chapter-link=\"track\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span><span>Track</span></a><a href=\"/#oversee\" data-chapter-link=\"oversee\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span><span>Oversee</span></a><a href=\"/#carry\" data-chapter-link=\"carry\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">04</span><span>Carry</span></a><a href=\"/#arrive\" data-chapter-link=\"arrive\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">05</span><span>Arrive</span></a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">When the evidence arrives</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Set an expiry date.<br>Schedule the next review.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Keep the person, requirement, supporting evidence and relevant date together. Your team can see what the record refers to and when to revisit it.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Use an expiry date where the credential has one. Use a review date where your organisation sets the next check.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The evidence and its date</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Inside a tracked record</p><dl class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Person</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Requirement</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Evidence</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Certificate.pdf</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Date type</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Expiry</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Date</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">30 Nov 2026</dd></div></dl></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">As the date approaches</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Find upcoming renewals.<br>Choose the next action.</h2><p class=\"copy\">See which records need attention and whose evidence needs updating. Go from a workforce view to the person’s record, with the context still there.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">A useful status tells your team what to inspect. The decision still belongs to the person reviewing the evidence.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / The team comes into view</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line pb-5\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Workforce overview</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold\">What needs attention?</h3></div><span class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Your team</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Manual handling</p></div><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Renewal due</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Alex Morgan</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Workplace induction</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Awaiting review</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Riley Ellis</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Requested evidence</p></div><span class=\"badge\">Missing</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-slate\">Open the person’s record to see the evidence behind the status.</p></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">When the evidence changes</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Renew the record.<br>Keep the history.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Review the replacement evidence, record the new date and keep the previous activity in context. The next review starts with a history your team can follow.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A continuous history</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6 text-blue\">Jamie’s record history</p><ol class=\"flex flex-col gap-7\"><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">12 May 2026</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-semibold\">Evidence added</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Expiry recorded as 30 Nov 2026.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">20 November 2026</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-semibold\">Replacement received</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">New certificate ready for review.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">21 November 2026</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-semibold\">Reviewed by your team</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">New expiry recorded as 30 Nov 2027.</p></li></ol></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">The story continues</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Connect current records<br>to the working day.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><p class=\"copy\">Tracked records connect onboarding to the worker app, your workforce overview and the moments people arrive on site.</p><a class=\"link self-start\" href=\"/#carry\">Continue with the worker app <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-24\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">See the connected workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">See how your team<br>can work in Certifyd.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Bring a role and the records you manage today. In 20 minutes, we’ll walk through your requirements, the team’s view and how people contribute their evidence.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a 20-minute demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
